# Public study repo — ignore only secrets, local activation files, and compiled artifacts.
# The 2,000-run outputs (results/) and the scoring/analysis (scoring/) ARE published content
# and are tracked. The 4.1 smoke calibration runs are not part of the published study.

# --- secrets: keys live in RESEARCH_* env vars, never on disk; defense in depth ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
*secret*
*.key
*.pem

# --- grader runtime activation (keyless: provider + model_id only; keys from env) ---
grader/GRADER_SETTINGS.json

# --- 4.1 smoke calibration runs (not the published 2,000-run study) ---
results_smoke/
scoring_smoke/

# --- python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS folder metadata
.DS_Store
